## Outcome

APP01-08 successfully secured the Nextcloud deployment using HTTPS and TLS encryption.

A self-signed SSL certificate was implemented, Apache was configured to support encrypted communication, HTTP traffic was automatically redirected to HTTPS, and recommended HTTP security headers were applied.

The server now provides encrypted communication for all user interactions and is prepared for identity and access management implementation in APP01-09.
